msgid "Maintain clear and verifiable documentation"
msgstr "维护清晰且可验证的文档"

msgid ""
"Use the [content and diagram standard](../design/documentation-standards.md)"
" and [five page templates](../design/documentation-templates.md) for every "
"new or changed page. Keep one authoritative contract and one canonical prose"
" source. Current implementation, target design and exact reference "
"configurations remain distinct."
msgstr ""
"新增或修改页面时，遵守[内容与图示标准](../design/documentation-"
"standards.md)和[五类页面模板](../design/documentation-"
"templates.md)。保留一份权威合同与一份正文源。当前实现、目标设计与精确参考配置分别表达。"

msgid "Write around a reader task"
msgstr "围绕读者任务写作"

msgid ""
"State the result, prerequisites and limit at the start. Explain who acts, on"
" what input, in which context, and what observable result or failure "
"follows. Use stable terms and explicit units. Keep raw hashes/logs in "
"evidence links rather than the operation narrative. Do not replace scope "
"with claims such as complete support."
msgstr ""
"开头说明结果、前提与限制。解释谁在什么上下文中处理什么输入，以及可以观察到什么结果或失败。使用稳定术语和明确单位。原始摘要／日志保存在证据链接中，不打断操作主线。不得用“完整支持”等结论替代明确范围。"

msgid ""
"Tutorials provide a complete maintained fixture or pinned external consumer,"
" actual commands, expected results and cleanup. Use literalinclude for "
"source-owned inputs. Fragments state why they are incomplete. Ordinary "
"document builds do not execute arbitrary Markdown commands, fetch latest "
"examples or operate hardware."
msgstr ""
"教程提供完整维护夹具或固定版本外部消费工程，以及实际命令、预期结果和清理步骤。源码拥有的输入使用 "
"literalinclude。片段必须说明不完整原因。普通文档构建不执行任意 Markdown 命令、不获取 latest 示例，也不操作硬件。"

msgid "Review diagrams and translations"
msgstr "审查图示与翻译"

msgid ""
"A diagram has an ID, scope, caption, alt text, editable source and local "
"SVG. Label arrow meanings, optional paths, owners and failure "
"responsibility. Review against actual code/contract, then render and inspect"
" text, line crossings, zoom, print and offline resources. Successful "
"rendering alone does not prove semantics."
msgstr ""
"图示具有 ID、范围、caption、alt、可编辑源和本地 "
"SVG。标明箭头含义、可选路径、所有者与失败责任。对照实际代码／合同审查，再渲染并检查文字、交叉线、放大、打印和离线资源。渲染成功本身不证明语义正确。"

msgid ""
"English canonical pages use gettext PO for Chinese; canonical Chinese "
"contracts keep their source language. A translation tracks the actual "
"canonical source digest, actual extracted messages and independent review. "
"Changed source, fuzzy or missing messages display the true status instead of"
" pretending a complete translation. Do not translate C symbols, "
"configuration keys, result codes or original receipts. Use the "
"{download}`reviewed bilingual terminology <../locale/terminology.csv>` for "
"these shared terms; its authority links preserve the single contract."
msgstr ""
"英文正文通过 gettext PO 提供中文；中文合同保留其原文语言。翻译绑定实际正文摘要、实际提取消息和独立审查。源变化、fuzzy "
"或消息缺失时，显示真实状态，不能冒充翻译完整。不得翻译 C 符号、配置键、结果码或原始回执。共享术语使用{download}`已审查双语术语表 "
"<../locale/terminology.csv>`；其权威链接维护单一合同。"

msgid "Apply the correct acceptance boundary"
msgstr "采用正确验收边界"

msgid ""
"Follow the unified document commands documented by the current CLI. A source"
" check, strict bilingual build, real configuration/consumer execution, "
"diagram audit, offline package and actual published-site check are separate "
"results. Record command exits and exact inputs; never claim deployment from "
"local HTML or hardware from a plan."
msgstr ""
"执行当前 CLI "
"文档中的统一文档命令。源码检查、严格双语构建、真实配置／消费工程执行、图示审查、离线包和实际站点检查分别建立结果。记录命令退出码与精确输入；不能从本地 "
"HTML 声称部署完成，或从准备计划声称硬件通过。"

msgid ""
"The {download}`documentation ledger <../design/documentation-system-"
"execution.csv>` owns implementation and validation exits. The migration map "
"preserves historical paths; old API redirects point to a version-aware "
"migration or history page, not silently to a different new function "
"contract. Retain qualification records at their original paths and "
"identities."
msgstr ""
"{download}`文档台账 <../design/documentation-system-"
"execution.csv>`维护实现和验证退出条件。迁移映射保留历史路径；旧 API "
"转向有版本意识的迁移或历史页面，不能静默解释为另一份新函数合同。资格记录保留原路径和身份。"
